# ============================================================================
# EYG Tire & Auto Care — Docker build context exclusions
# Keep the context small and, more importantly, make it *impossible* to bake a
# secret or the raw brand research into an image layer. Docker treats any file
# listed here as "does not exist" for both `COPY` and `ADD`.
# ============================================================================

# ---------- Version control ----------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.hg
.svn

# ---------- Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the image) ----------
node_modules
.next
out
.turbo
.vercel
.cache
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ---------- Secrets: NEVER ship into a layer ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
.sentryclirc
.sshtunnel/

# ---------- Brand research: raw assets, briefs and large binaries ----------
# `brand/` holds the raw logo/profile imagery and research notes. The *derived*
# web assets already live in `public/` and are all the image needs.
brand/
docs/research/
docs/brand/
content/
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tiff
*.tif
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch

# ---------- Tests, CI and QA ----------
tests/
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
.lighthouseci/
# A GLOB, deliberately. These are excluded by exact name, and `tsconfig.json`
# includes `**/*.ts` — so any vitest config that survives into the image is
# type-checked by `next build`. `vitest.inventory.config.ts` imports
# `./vitest.config`, which this file removes, and the build died with
#
#   Type error: Cannot find module './vitest.config' or its corresponding
#   type declarations.
#
# A build that had never compiled before (the base image tag did not exist) is
# the only thing that could find that. `vitest*.config.ts` covers the next one.
vitest*.config.ts
playwright*.config.ts
*.lcov
junit*.xml

# ---------- Docs (not needed at runtime; saves ~1 MB) ----------
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# ---------- Ops artefacts & backups ----------
backups/
restore-dry-run/
*.dump
*.dump.enc
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.log
logs/

# ---------- Tooling / editor / OS ----------
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~
.eslintcache
.mcp.json

# ---------- Generated OG images are committed on purpose ----------
# `public/og/*.png` IS needed by the runtime (referenced by src/lib/seo.ts).
# It is built inside the builder stage from scripts/generate-og.mjs when absent.
